# Progressive jackpot pool — an ExactOdds casino rule pack.
#
# Progressive pools grow by a fixed contribution of every bet and reset to
# the seed the moment someone wins. Players should be able to verify the
# pool is where the casino says it is: this program takes the starting pool,
# the bets, and the contribution rate, and reproduces the pool exactly.
#
# Rules: each bet adds bet * contrib_pct / 100 to the pool (integer division
# floors, fractions of a cent stay with the house). After a jackpot win the
# pool resets to the published seed — never to zero, never to a number the
# casino picks after the fact.

def jackpot_pool_after(pool_cents: int, bet_cents: int, contrib_pct: int) -> int do
    ret pool_cents + bet_cents * contrib_pct / 100
end

def jackpot_reset(seed_cents: int) -> int do
    ret seed_cents
end

# Audited cases: $10,000 pool, $10 bet at 2%, seed $5,000.
say(jackpot_pool_after(1000000, 1000, 2))
say(jackpot_pool_after(1000020, 500, 2))
say(jackpot_reset(500000))
